<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">jas</book>
  <para style="h">Yaki Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yaki Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yaki Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Dɛnkɛlɛya muxune lan e xa bira kiraan naxanye fɔxɔ ra e dunuɲa yi gidini, ne nan sɛbɛxi Yaki a kitabu yiren kui a naxan sɛbɛxi Alaa yamaan birin ma naxanye xuyaxi ayi dunuɲa xun xɔn ma (1.1). Muxu wuyaxi laxi a ra, Yaki ito nan findixi Yesu xunyɛna nde ra. A tan ma fe falaxi Kitabun yireni itoe yi: Xɛrane 15.13, 21.18, Kɔrɛnti Singen 15.7, Galati 1.19, 2.9, 2.12, Yudi 1.1. Na nan Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ma alogo a xa e sigati kiin yita e ra e bode tagi e nun lan dɛnkɛlɛyatarene ma. Yesu xunyɛ Yaki findixi Yerusalɛn dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan yɛɛratina nde nan na. Yaki naxan findixi Yesu a xarandiin na, na mi findɛ Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛ muxun na bayo Manga Herode bata na Yaki faxa nun sinma naxan findixi Yesu a xarandiin na (a mato Xɛrane Kɛwanle 12.2 kui).</para>
  <para style="ip">A sɛbɛ kiin maligaxi Sandane kitabu yiren nan na Layiri Fonna Kitabu yiren kui naxan yi Alaa fe kolonna mayitama a yamaan na. Kitabun yireni ito fan Alaa fe kolonna mayitama Yesu a kiraan xɔn. Yaki fe kolonna nan ma fe singe falama fa fala a a kelixi Ala nan ma e nun muxun lan a Ala maxɔdin a ma dɛnkɛlɛyani (1.2-8). Na na dangu, falane xunna tixi yiigelitɔyaan nun nafulu kanyaan nan ma, e nun tantan feene nun mantɔrɔne e nun dina kɛndɛna, naxan lan a xa wali faɲine kɛ (1.9-27). Yaki mɔn a falama a e nama muxune rafisa e bode xa lan e yii seene ma (2.1-13). Na danguxina a yi fa a fala kɛndɛn ma, dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun kɛwanle tagiin kii naxan yi (2.14-26). A yi a fala a yɛtɛ suxun xɔdɔxɔ lɛnna nun fala xuiin mabinni. (3.1-12). Na danguxina, a fa fe kolon kɛndɛna fe ma (3.13-18). A yi na muxune maxadi naxanye yɛngɛn nakelima e nun naxanye findixi dunuɲa muxune xɔyine ra, a yi falan ti nafulu kanne xili ma naxanye ɲaxu e walikɛne ra (4.1-5.6). Falan naɲandeni, a yi a fala a muxune xa diɲa, e Ala maxandi waxatin birin yi, e yi e bode mali dɛnkɛlɛyani (5.7-20).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito kankanma falan naxan ma naxan sɛbɛxi dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ma a fixa: I nama la Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin na i xaxili gbansanni tun, fɔ dɛnkɛlɛyaan xa lu i kɛwanle yi, bayo xa “dɛnkɛlɛyaan naxan mi findi kɛwanle ra, na faxaxi na a ra.” (2.26).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>N tan Yaki, Ala nun Marigi Yesu a Muxu Sugandixina walikɛna, n ni ito sɛbɛxi Isirayila bɔnsɔn fu nun firinne nan ma naxanye xuyaxi ayi siyane tagi. N bata ɛ xɔntɔn.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun fe kolonna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Ngaxakedenne, mantɔrɔn sifa wuyaxi na ɛ li, ɛ xa na yatɛ sɛwan dɛfexin na, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>bayo ɛ a kolon, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan na tɔrɔyane raxan, na a ligama nɛn ɛ tunnafanna sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Koni fɔ tunnafanna xa wali kamalixin nan kɛ, alogo ɛ xa kamali ɛ yi dɛfe. Sese nama dasa ɛ ma. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Xa fe kolonna dasaxi ɛ tan nde ma, a xa a maxɔdin Ala ma, naxan muxune birin kima a fonisireyani, a mɔn mi na kanna yalagima. A soma nɛn a yii. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Koni a xa a maxɔdin dɛnkɛlɛyaan nin, a nama sikɛ. Bayo naxan na sikɛ, na luxi nɛn alo fɔxɔ igen walanna, foyen naxan nasigama, a a raxɛtɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Na muxu sifan nama a miri fa fala a seen sɔtɛ Marigin yii nɛn. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Amasɔtɔ xaxili firin kanna nan na ra, a mi raxaraxi a feene yi.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiigelitɔɔn nun nafulu kanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Dɛnkɛlɛya muxu yiigelitɔɔn xa sɛwa amasɔtɔ Ala bata a yite. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Nafulu kanna fan xa sɛwa amasɔtɔ Ala bata a ragodo, bayo nafulu kanna fe danguma nɛn alo sɛxɛ fuge faɲina. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Sogen na xɔlɔ, a wuyenna yi sɛxɛn xara, a ɲingine yi lisi a ra, a fugene yi yolon, a tofanna yi dangu. Nafulu kanna fan ma binyen lɔma ayi na kii nin a nɛma a feene rawalima.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maratantan feene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Sɛwan na kanna xa naxan a tunnafanma tɔrɔni, amasɔtɔ Ala na yelin a kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ, a nii rakisin taxamaseri kɔmɔtin soma nɛn a xun na, Ala bata a xanu muxune tuli sa naxan na. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Naxan na bira tantan feni waxatin naxan yi, na kanna nama a fala, a naxa, “Ala nan n natantanma.” Amasɔtɔ Ala mi ratantanɲɛ fe ɲaxini, a fan mi muxe ratantanma. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Koni muxun birin tantanma a yɛtɛna kunfa feene nan xɔn ma naxanye a mabandunma, e yi a kɛnɛn. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Na xanbi ra, kunfa ɲaxin sa findima yulubin nan na. Yulubin na kɔxɔ waxatin naxan yi, a raɲanma sayaan nan ma.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Ngaxakeden xanuntenne, ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ mayenden. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Kise faɲin birin, fɛ mi naxan na, na fataxi kore xɔnna nan na, keli Fafe Ala yii naxan kore xɔnna yanban seene daxi. A mi maxɛtɛma alo nininna! <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>A bata a ragidi a en xa balo a ɲɔndi falan xɔn ma alogo en xa findi a dali fisamantenne ra.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe mɛɛn nun a ligana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Ngaxakeden xanuntenne, ɛ xa a kolon, fa fala muxun birin xa mafura falan namɛ, koni ɛ nama mafura falan tiyɛ. Ɛ nama xɔlɔ sinma. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu xɔlɔxin mi fɛ Alaa tinxinyaan na. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Nayi, ɛ xa fe xɔsixine birin yiba e nun fe ɲaxin naxanye waraxi ayi. Ɛ yi na falan suxu limaniyani, a naxan saxi ɛ bɔɲɛni, naxan nɔɛ ɛ niin nakisɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Ɛ nama ɛ tuli mati Alaa falan na tun, ɛ yi ɛ yɛtɛ mayenden, fɔ ɛ xa a liga nɛn. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan a tuli matima Alaa falan na, a mi a liga, na luxi nɛn alo muxun naxan a yɛtɛ matoma kikeni, <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>a na yelin a yɛtɛ matoɛ, a siga, a ɲinan a yɛtagin kiin xɔn sa! <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Koni naxan na sariya kamalixin tilinna fɛsɛfɛsɛ, sariyan naxan muxun xɔrɔyama, a lu a fari, a mi a tuli mati a ra tun a yi ɲinan a xɔn, koni a yi a liga, na kanna sɛwan sɔtɔma nɛn a kɛwanla xɔn.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Xa muxuna nde a yɛtɛ yatɛxi dina muxun na, koni a mi a lɛnna mara, a bata a yɛtɛ mayenden, a dinan findima fe fuun nan na. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Dinan naxan sariɲan, fɛ mi naxan na Fafe Ala yɛɛ ra yi, na ni ito ra: Ɛ ɲɔxɔ lu kiridine nun kaɲa gilɛne xɔn e tɔrɔne yi. Ɛ yi ɛ yɛtɛ ratanga dunuɲa fe xɔsixine ma.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ nama muxune rafisa e bode xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ to dɛnkɛlɛyaxi en Marigin binyen kanna Yesu ma, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina, ɛ nama muxune rafisa e bode xa. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Xa muxuna nde so ɛ malanni xɛmaan yiisolirasoon soxi a yiin na, doma faɲin nagodoxi a ma, na xanbi ra yiigelitɔɔn fan yi so, dunkobine ragodoxi a ma, <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>ɛ yi ɛ yengi dɔxɔ dugi faɲin kanna xɔn, ɛ yi a fala a xa, ɛ naxa, “Fa i magodo gbɛdɛ faɲini,” koni ɛ a fala yiigelitɔɔn ma fa fala “Ti mɛnni,” hanma “Dɔxɔ n sanna dɛxɔn ma bɔxɔni,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>xa ɛ na liga, ɛ mi muxune rafisaxi e bode xa ba? Ɛ mi tagi rabaan xan tima ɛ miriya ɲaxine yi nayi ba?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Ngaxakeden xanuntenne, ɛ tuli mati. Ala mi yiigelitɔne xan sugandi dunuɲa yi, alogo e dɛnkɛlɛyaan xa findi e bannayaan na, e yi mangayaan sɔtɔ e kɛɛn na, Ala bata a xanu muxune tuli sa naxan na? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Koni ɛ tan yiigelitɔne rafɛyama! Nafulu kanne xa mi ɛ rawalima ba, e yi ɛ xali kitisadeni? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Ne xa mi ɛ kanna xili faɲin kalama ba?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Xa ɛ Manga Alaa sariyan nakamalima yati, naxan Kitabun kui, ɛ bata fe faɲin liga nayi, a naxa, “I adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna.” <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Koni xa ɛ muxune rafisa e bode xa, nayi ɛ bata yulubin liga. Na ma, sariyan fan ɛ sɔnna yitama ɛ ra nɛn bayo ɛ mi a suxi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Bayo xa muxun sariyan birin suxu, a yi keden peen kala, a bata e birin kala na yi. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Bayo naxan a falaxi fa fala i nama yalunyaan liga, na nan mɔn a falaxi, a i nama faxan ti. Nayi, xa i mi yalunyaan liga koni i muxun faxa, i bata findi sariya kalan na na yi. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Ɛ sigati kiin nun ɛ falati kiin xa lan na sariyan ma naxan xɔrɔyaan fima bayo ɛ makitima na nan xɔn. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala kininkinintarene makitima kininkinintareyaan nin. Anu, kininkininna nan kitin nɔma.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun kɛwanle fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Ngaxakedenne, tɔnɔn mundun na ra xa muxuna nde a fala a dɛnkɛlɛyaxi, xa a kɛwanle mi a yitama? Na dɛnkɛlɛyana a rakisɛ ba? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>A luxi nɛn alo marabɛnna nɛma ngaxakedenna nde ma, xɛmɛna hanma ɲaxanla, a balon mi a yii. <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>Awa, xa ɛ tan nde a fala na nde ma, ɛ naxa, “Ɛ siga bɔɲɛ xunbenli. Ɛ sa ɛ maxara, ɛ yi lugo.” Xa ɛ mi e ki e fatin mako ma seene yi, na tɔnɔn nanse ra? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan fan na kii nin, xa wali faɲi mi dɛnkɛlɛyani a faxaxin na ra na yi.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Koni muxuna nde a falama nɛn, a naxa, “Dɛnkɛlɛyana i tan yi, koni kɛwanle nan n tan yi.” N na a yabima nɛn, n naxa, i ya dɛnkɛlɛyaan yitama n na di, ba i kɛwanle ra? N tan xa dɛnkɛlɛyaan yita i ra n kɛwanle xɔn. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Ɛ laxi a ra ba fa fala Ala keden peen na a ra? Na lanxi. Hali ɲinanne fan laxi na ra, e xuruxurun gaxuni. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>I tan xaxilitarena, i mi a kolon ba, fa fala kɛwali faɲi mi dɛnkɛlɛyaan naxan yi, na nɛɛn fuu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>En benba Iburahima mi yatɛ tinxin muxun na Ala yɛɛ ra yi a kɛwanle xan xɔn ba, a to a dii xɛmɛna Isiyaga ba saraxan na saraxa ganden fari? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>I bata a to? A dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun a kɛwanle nan walixi e bode xɔn ma. A kɛwanla nan a dɛnkɛlɛyaan nakamalixi. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Kitabuna falan nakamali na nin, a naxa, “Iburahima yi dɛnkɛlɛya Ala ma, Ala fan yi na yatɛ tinxinna ra a xa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.23</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 15.6 kui.</note> Nanara, e yi a fala a ma fa fala “Ala xɔyina.” <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Awa, ɛ bata a to, fa fala muxun natinxinma Ala yɛɛ ra yi a kɛwanle nan fan xɔn, a dɛnkɛlɛyaan gbansan mi a ra.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Na kiini, hali yalunde ɲaxanla, Raxabi fan tinxin nɛn Ala yɛɛ ra yi a kɛwanle xɔn ma, a to Yahudiyane xɛrane yisuxu ki faɲi, a yi kira gbɛtɛ yita e ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.25</char> Yosuwe 2.1-21</note> <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Fati bɛndɛn nun niin na fata, fatin bata faxa na yi. Na kiini, dɛnkɛlɛyaan fan faxaxi na a ra xa kɛwanle mi a yi.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lɛnna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ wuyaxi nama findi karamɔxɔne ra, amasɔtɔ ɛ a kolon fa fala nxu tan karamɔxɔne gbee kitin xɔdɔxɔma ayi nɛn bonne gbeen xa. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>En birin tantanma kii wuyaxi. Muxun naxan mi tantanma fala tideni mumɛ, muxu kamalixin nan na ra, a nɔɛ a yɛtɛ xurɛ nɛn. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>A luxi nɛn alo en na karafen bira soon dɛɛn ma, a a xa en sagoon liga. Nayi, a gbindin birin birama na nan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Kunkin fan na kii nin. Hali a to gbo, foye gbeen mɔn a rasigama, koni se xurudin nan a matinxinma kunki ragiin sagoon ma. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Lɛnna fan na kii nin, a xurun fatin yirene yɛ koni a kanba fala gbeene nan tima. Tɛɛdin fan nɔɛ burun gbeen ganɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Awa, lɛnna fan luxi nɛn alo tɛɛna. En fati yirene yɛ, tinxintareyaan birin en lɛnna nin. A tan nan muxun gbindin birin birama xɔsini, alo a yi tɛɛn nan soma a dunuɲa yi gidin mumɛɛn na! Na tɛɛn yɛtɛɛn kelixi yahannama nin. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Adamadiine nɔɛ burunna suben sifane birin xurɛ nɛn, xɔline nun bubu seene nun yɛxɛne. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Koni muxu yo munma lɛnna xuru. Se ɲaxin nan a ra naxan mi raxaraxi. A rafexi dabarin nan na, muxu faxa xinla ma. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>En barikan birama en Marigin nun en Fafe Ala xa lɛnna nan na, en mɔn muxune dangama a ra Ala naxanye daxi a maligan na. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Barika biran nun dangan minima dɛ kedenna nin. Ngaxakedenne, na mi daxa mumɛ! <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Ige bɛxin nun fɔxɔ igen nɔɛ minɛ tigin mundun kedenna? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Ngaxakedenne, xɔdɛ binla nɔɛ oliwi bogin naminɛ nɛn ba? Manpa bogi binla nɔɛ xɔdɛ bogin naminɛ ba? Ige bɛxin mɔn mi sɔtɔma fɔxɔ igen dɛ.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe kolonna fata Ala ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Xaxilimaan nun fekolonna nde ra ɛ yɛ? A xa na mayita fata a sigati ki faɲin na, e nun a kɛwanla naxanye fataxi limaniyaan nun xaxilimayaan na. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Koni xa xɔxɔlɔnna nun yɛtɛ yigboon nan ɛ bɔɲɛni, ɛ ba ɛ yɛtɛ matɔxɛ, ɛ nama wulen fala ɲɔndin fari. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Na xaxili sifan mi kelixi ariyanna xan yi. Na fataxi dunuɲa nun fati bɛndɛn nun Yinna Manga Setana nan na. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Amasɔtɔ xɔxɔlɔnyaan nun yɛtɛ yigboon dɛnaxan yi, fe yibasanna nun fe ɲaxin sifan birin nan mɛnni. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Koni fe kolonna naxan sa kelixi ariyanna yi, a singen naxan na, a sariɲan, a mɔn bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima, a diɲaxi, a mafan mi raxɔlɔ, a lugoxi kininkininna nun kɛwali faɲin nan na. A mi muxune rafisama e bode xa. A mi nafigiyaan ligama. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Fe yitɔnna naxanye walima bɔɲɛ xunbenli, ne tinxinna nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ xuru Ala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Yɛngɛne nun matandin naxanye ɛ tagi, ne kelixi minɛn yi? Ne mi kelixi ɛ rafan fe ɲaxine xan yi ba naxanye ɛ fati bɛndɛn nakunfama? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Sena nde xɔnla ɛ ma, koni ɛ mi a sɔtɔma. Nanara, ɛ faxan tima, ɛ mila, koni ɛ mi nɔɛ a sɔtɛ. Ɛ yɛngɛne so, ɛ matandine ti. Se mi ɛ yii bayo ɛ mi Ala maxandima. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ɛ na Ala xandi seen naxan yi, ɛ mi a sɔtɔma, bayo ɛ Ala maxandi xunna kobi, amasɔtɔ ɛ yɛtɛ rafan feene nan tun fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Ɛ tan tinxintarene! Ɛ mi a kolon ba, fa fala a dunuɲa xanuntenyaan findixi Alaa fe xɔnnantenyaan nan na? Muxun naxan na a yɛtɛ findi dunuɲa xɔyin na, na bata a yɛtɛ findi Ala yaxun na. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Ɛ laxi a ra ba, a Kitabun falan tixi nɛn tun? A naxa, “Ala bata Niin naxan sa en yi, na rafan a ma han!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.5</char> Ala waxi a xɔn ma nɛn, a niin naxan saxi muxune yi, e nama na sa se gbɛtɛ sagoni, e yi na seen batu.</note> <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Koni Alaa hinanna luma fari sɛ nɛn en xa, amasɔtɔ a mɔn a falaxi, a naxa, “Ala wasodene yikalama e feene yi, koni a hinanma nɛn yɛtɛ magodone ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.6</char> Sandane 3.34</note>” <verse eid="JAS 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Nanara, ɛ xuru Ala ma, ɛ ɛ kankan Yinna Manga Setana yɛɛ ra, a gima nɛn ɛ bun. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Ɛ maso Ala ra, a masoma ɛ ra nɛn. Yulubitɔne, ɛ ɛ yulubi yiine raxa. Ɛ tan nafigine, ɛ bɔɲɛne rasariɲan! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Ɛ nimisa ɛ hakɛne fe ra, ɛ sunu, ɛ wuga! Ɛ gelen xa maxɛtɛ wugan na. Ɛ sɛwan yi findi nii yifɔrɛn na. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Ɛ magodo Marigin xa, a ɛ yitema nɛn.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛ nama ɛ bode yalagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ nama ɛ bode mafala. Muxu yo a ngaxakedenna mafala hanma a yi a yalagi, na kanna bata Alaa sariyan mafala, a yi a yalagi. Xa i sariyan yalagi, sariya suxu mi fa i ra nayi sɔnɔn, i to a yalagima. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Sariyasa keden peen nun kitisa keden peen nan na, naxan nɔɛ marakisin nun halagin tiyɛ. Koni i tan, nde i tan na, i to i adamadi boden yalagima?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">I nama findi wasoden na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Ɛ tuli mati, ɛ tan naxanye a falama, ɛ naxa, “To hanma tila nxu sigama taana nde yi, nxu sa ɲɛɛn nadangu na, nxu sa yulayaan naba na, nxu tɔnɔna nde sɔtɔ.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Anu, ɛ mi a kolon naxan ligama ɛ dunuɲa yi gidini tila! Amasɔtɔ ɛ luxi nɛn alo kundaan naxan godoma, a waxatidi ti, na xanbi ra a tunun. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>A lanma nɛn ɛ xa ito nan fala, ɛ naxa, “Xa Marigin tin, nxu luma nxu nii ra nɛn, nxu feni ito liga hanma na.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Koni iki ɛ wasoma, ɛ yɛtɛ matɔxɔma. Na yɛtɛ matɔxɔn sifan birin ɲaxu. <verse eid="JAS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Nanara, xa muxun mi fe faɲin liga, anu a kolon a lanma a xa naxan liga, na kanna bata yulubin sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Nafulu kanna fe falana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Ɛ tan nafulu kanne, ɛ tuli mati. Ɛ wuga, ɛ gbelegbele tɔrɔyana fe ra naxan fama ɛ lideni. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Ɛ nafunle bata kala. Xiine bata ɛ dugine don. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Xɔrinxɔrinna bata ɛ xɛmane nun gbeti gbananne suxu. Xɔrinxɔrinni ito findima nɛn sereyaan na ɛ xili ma. A yi ɛ fati bɛndɛn don alo tɛɛna, bayo ɛ nafunla malanxi waxati dɔnxɛn nin. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Walikɛɛn naxanye ɛ xɛɛ ma seene xabaxi, ɛ mi naxanye saranna fixi, ɛ mi ne mawuga xuiin mɛma ɛ xili ma ba? Naxanye ɛ se xabaxine malanxi, ne wuga xuiin bata Marigin li, Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Ɛ bata lu dunuɲa yi ɲaxunna nun yɛtɛ rafan feene yi. Ɛ bata ɛ yɛtɛ raɲaxun alo xuruse faxa daxine. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Ɛ bata tinxin muxune yalagi, ɛ yi e faxa, naxanye mi yi tixi ɛ kanke.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Diɲan nun maxandina fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Nanara, ngaxakedenne, ɛ diɲa han Marigin yi fa. Ɛ miri xɛɛ biina diɲan ma, a a xɛɛn mamɛma waxatin naxan yi, a yi a tɔnɔne sɔtɔ. A diɲama nɛn han tule singene nun a raɲanne yi fa. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Ɛ fan xa diɲa na kiini, ɛ yi ɛ wɛkilɛ amasɔtɔ Marigin fa waxatin bata maso.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ nama ɛ bode mafala, xanamu Ala ɛ makitima nɛn. Kitisaan famatɔɔn ni i ra. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Ngaxakedenne, nabiin naxanye falan ti Marigina fe yi, naxanye diɲa tɔrɔni, ne fe xa findi misaala ra ɛ xa. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>En na a falama ne ma nɛn a sɛwana e xa amasɔtɔ e e tunnafan nɛn. Ɛ bata Yuba a tunnafanna fe mɛ, ɛ mɔn bata a mɛ Marigin naxan liga a xa a raɲanni. Amasɔtɔ kininkininna nun fanna kanna nan Marigin na.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Ngaxakedenne, na birin yi, ɛ nama ɛ kɔlɔ ariyanna yi hanma dunuɲa bɔxɔ xɔnna hanma sese. Koni i ya “ɔn” xa findi ɔnna ra, i ya “ɛn-ɛn,” na yi findi ɛn-ɛnna ra alogo i nama bira Alaa kitini.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Tɔrɔ muxuna nde ɛ yɛ ba? Na kanna xa Ala maxandi. Muxuna nde sɛwaxi ɛ yɛ ba? Na kanna xa bɛtin ba. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Furetɔna nde ɛ yɛ ba? A xa dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan fonne xili, e yi Ala maxandi a xa, e a masusan turen na Marigin xinli. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Ala maxandina dɛnkɛlɛyani, na furetɔni yalanma nɛn. Marigin furetɔɔn nakelima nɛn. Xa a bata yulubin naxanye liga, Ala a mafeluma nɛn ne ra. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Nanara, ɛ ti ɛ yulubine ra ɛ bode xa, ɛ yi Ala maxandi ɛ bode xa, alogo ɛ xa yiyalan. Tinxin muxuna Ala maxandin sɛnbɛn gbo, a feene gasama. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Adamadiin nan yi Nabi Eli ra alo en tan. A yi Ala maxandi han, a tulen nama fa. Tulen mi fa yamanani han ɲɛɛ saxan e nun a tagi. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>A mɔn yi Ala maxandi, tulen yi fa, bogi seene yi bogi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.18</char> Na feen sɛbɛxi Mangane Singen 17.1 kui.</note><verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Ngaxakedenne, xa muxuna nde a mɛ ɲɔndin na ɛ yɛ, muxu gbɛtɛ yi a raxɛtɛ ɲɔndin kiraan xɔn, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>ɛ xa a kolon a muxun naxan yulubi kanna bama a tantanna kiraan xɔn, na bata a niin nakisi faxan ma, a yulubi wuyaxi xafarin sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
